{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米跟祭司巴施户珥冲突"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["祭司音麦的儿子巴施户珥作耶和华殿的总管，听见耶利米预言这些事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他就打先知耶利米，用耶和华殿里便雅悯高门内的枷，将他枷在那里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["次日，巴施户珥将耶利米开枷释放。于是耶利米对他说：「耶和华不是叫你的名为巴施户珥，乃是叫你玛歌珥·米撒毕",{"noteId":24},"，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因耶和华如此说：『我必使你自觉惊吓，你也必使众朋友惊吓；他们必倒在仇敌的刀下，你也必亲眼看见；我必将犹大人全交在巴比伦王的手中，他要将他们掳到巴比伦去，也要用刀将他们杀戮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["并且我要将这城中的一切货财和劳碌得来的，并一切珍宝，以及犹大君王所有的宝物，都交在他们仇敌的手中；仇敌要当作掠物带到巴比伦去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你这巴施户珥和一切住在你家中的人都必被掳去；你和你的众朋友，就是你向他们说假预言的，都必到巴比伦去，要死在那里，葬在那里。』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米埋怨耶和华"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，你曾劝导我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也听了你的劝导。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你比我有力量，且胜了我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我终日成为笑话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人都戏弄我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我每逢讲论的时候，就发出哀声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我喊叫说：有强暴和毁灭！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的话终日成了我的凌辱、讥刺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我若说：我不再提耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再奉他的名讲论，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我便心里觉得","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"似乎有烧着的火闭塞在我骨中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就含忍不住，不能自禁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我听见了许多人的谗谤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四围都是惊吓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我知己的朋友也都窥探我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿我跌倒，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"告他吧，我们也要告他！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或者他被引诱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们就能胜他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他身上报仇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，耶和华与我同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像甚可怕的勇士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，逼迫我的必都绊跌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能得胜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必大大蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是受永不忘记的羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们行事没有智慧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"试验义人、察看人肺腑心肠的万军之耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你容我见你在他们身上报仇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我将我的案件向你禀明了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你们要向耶和华唱歌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赞美耶和华！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他救了穷人的性命脱离恶人的手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"愿我生的那日受咒诅；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿我母亲产我的那日不蒙福！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"给我父亲报信说「你得了儿子」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我父亲甚欢喜的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那人受咒诅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那人像耶和华所倾覆而不后悔的城邑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他早晨听见哀声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晌午听见呐喊；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他在我未出胎的时候不杀我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我母亲成了我的坟墓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"胎就时常重大。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我为何出胎见劳碌愁苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的年日因羞愧消灭呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":24,"caller":"-","text":"就是四面惊吓的意思","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}